    "chunk_text": "Men \u00fea leofeste, sanctus Matheus \u00fee godspellere, \u00fee \u00f0is godspel wrat, s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee H\u00e6lend spec to his & cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00f0a gyt \u00fe\u00e6t summe \u00fea \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6r weron ne sceolden dea\u00fe\u00e6s onfon \u00e6r \u00feam \u00fee heo segen hine sylfen \u00d0a embe six niht \u00e6fter \u00fean \u00fee Crist heom \u00feas word s\u00e6de, he nom mid him \u00fea his \u00fereo leorningcniht\u00e6s, \u00dea feringe wear\u00f0 Cristes anseone swi\u00f0e wunderlice f\u00e6ger iworden beforen heom \u00ferym, swa \u00fe\u00e6t his \u00dea r\u00e6dlice \u00e6tsceawede him \u00fe\u00e6r Moyses \u00fee halg\u00e6 \u00fee \u00fee ifyrren worlde \u00e6r w\u00e6s for\u00f0f\u00e6ren & Heli\u00e6s \u00fee Sona swa \u00fea halige \u00feein\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t wundor swa mycel is\u00e6gen, \u00fea s\u00e6de Petrus to Criste, Drihten, god is us \u00dea imong \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00feus speken \u00fea com \u00fe\u00e6r f\u00e6ringe swi\u00f0e beorht genip, vel mist,& heom ealle Son\u00e6 swa \u00fea Cristes \u00feeign\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t mycele wundor is\u00e6gen & \u00fea f\u00e6derlice stefne ih\u00e6rdon, \u00fea w\u00e6ren heo \u00d0a neahl\u00e6chede heom \u00fee Healend, & ran heom, & heom up ahof, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to heom, Aris\u00e6\u00f0 & ne \u00dea hyo heor\u00e6 eagen up ahof\u00e6n, & arison, \u00fea ne isegen heo neo\u00feer ne Moyses ne Helias, ne n\u00e6nne mon \u00dea \u00f0e heo eft ny\u00f0er of \u00f0are dune eoden, \u00fea bead Crist heom \u00fereom \u00fee \u00fea wunderlice sih\u00f0e isegen, \u00fe\u00e6t Leof",
